{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265KP2kEv7n91794733310.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國晶片龍頭輝達創辦人黃仁勳承認婚外情，被指是中國間諜，以及外遇對象之一的女商人黃樂，已離任新加坡雲端運算公司Megaspeed。</p><p></p><p>Megaspeed表示，黃樂已於去年8月30日正式離任，目前在該公司並無任何職務，又拒絕對黃樂私人生活作出評論。</p><p></p><p>Megaspeed指，公司是輝達核心商業夥伴，又表示涉及其業務供應鏈及運作，指Megaspeed涉出售晶片到中國的報道缺乏證據支持，已招聘第三方法律顧問調查相關報道。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:58:47.231523+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T09:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T08:48:39.304574+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T09:52:34.922018+00:00","content_hash":"fde84663bfc5bea7312be5bf68ab05d936bbbf32040939a981f8224193881863","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:58:47.231523+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}